{"schemaVersion":1,"id":287,"sections":[{"id":"538001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20700],"start":0,"count":30},{"id":"538001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20701],"start":30,"count":9}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:1","scriptId":20700,"text":"炎炎烈日，开车驰骋在北非的沙漠上，实在是苦不堪言。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:2","scriptId":20700,"text":"“选这种天气来北非调查简直比蒸桑拿还要辛苦。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:3","scriptId":20700,"text":"“还好吧，这北非应该都是这种天气。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:4","scriptId":20700,"text":"“你们有体内调温功能，当然还好啦……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:5","scriptId":20700,"text":"本次的目的地是拉巴特附近的一个村落，据报告称那里发生了特殊的海市蜃楼。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:6","scriptId":20700,"text":"由于是休假期间的紧急任务，所以就召集了在还基地的佐伊和佩妮便匆匆赶赴现场了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:7","scriptId":20700,"text":"“明明是本地的常见现象，但最近有好几个村民迷失在了海市蜃楼之中。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:8","scriptId":20700,"text":"“让本地的特勤局接手调查不就好了嘛……为了一点点委托费就这么差遣人……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:9","scriptId":20700,"text":"听闻是皇室相关的委托，死水也想和他们搞好关系吧。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:10","scriptId":20700,"text":"“唉……总之苦的就是我们这种马前卒啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:11","scriptId":20700,"text":"不过这里除去太阳比较热辣以外，也就是风沙稍微大点，战车兽什么的根本无处躲藏。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:12","scriptId":20700,"text":"“嗯，算是不幸中的万幸，在这种地方作战什么的，那硝烟的热度……可就真是人间炼狱了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:13","scriptId":20700,"text":"话语间，吉普车已经驶达了目的地。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-20.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:15","scriptId":20700,"text":"这是一座很偏僻的小镇，几乎可以被认为是荒无人烟，只有零星几个居民正坐在墙角的阴影处。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:16","scriptId":20700,"text":"“这小镇好像有点问题，怎么感觉人们一点生气都没有……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:17","scriptId":20700,"text":"“确实，看上去一点活力都没有，难道都被热得趴窝了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:18","scriptId":20700,"text":"“可以先实地考察一下，问问这里的居民？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:19","scriptId":20700,"text":"佩妮走向那几个坐在阴影处的居民，结果那些居民看到佩妮就像见了鬼一样，嗖得一下跑没影了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:20","scriptId":20700,"text":"“…………这是怎么回事？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:21","scriptId":20700,"text":"“佩妮那么可爱，怎么会吃闭门羹，这也太不正常了！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:22","scriptId":20700,"text":"“可能因为是钢舞姬的关系？我也想不到其他的原因了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:23","scriptId":20700,"text":"这时，天空突然被风沙所遮蔽，巨大的龙卷夹杂着沙尘笔直冲向小镇。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:24","scriptId":20700,"text":"“什么情况，可没说过这里会有沙尘暴啊？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:25","scriptId":20700,"text":"“佩妮，快回吉普车里来。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:26","scriptId":20700,"text":"“嗯。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:27","scriptId":20700,"text":"沙尘暴来得快去得也快，只刮了半个小时不到就消失得无影无踪了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:28","scriptId":20700,"text":"“我靠……沙漠里的天气真是变幻莫测……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:29","scriptId":20700,"text":"奇怪的事情发生了，周围的小镇凭空消失了。取而代之的是几头战车兽正虎视眈眈地望着吉普车。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:30","scriptId":20700,"text":"“虽然不知道发生了什么，但现在先要处理眼前的战车兽，姐姐，准备作战。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-PROLOGUE:20700:31","scriptId":20700,"text":"“来了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"538001-EPILOGUE:20701:0","scriptId":20701,"text":"区区几只战车兽根本不是佐伊她们的对手，很快就被干掉了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-EPILOGUE:20701:1","scriptId":20701,"text":"“有点奇怪啊……刚才干掉的战车兽怎么没留下尸骸？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-EPILOGUE:20701:2","scriptId":20701,"text":"“难道这里就是报告里的海市蜃楼发生点？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-EPILOGUE:20701:3","scriptId":20701,"text":"“这么一说的话，确实有可能……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"538001-EPILOGUE:20701:4","scriptId":20701,"text":"想要确认周围的情况，但发现就算把眼睛真得再大，也无法看清周边的环境，","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-EPILOGUE:20701:5","scriptId":20701,"text":"“你们注意不要离吉普车太远了，如果在这里走散了那可是会出人命的。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-EPILOGUE:20701:6","scriptId":20701,"text":"“了解，姐姐，我们保持离吉普车的位置最多不超过三米。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"538001-EPILOGUE:20701:7","scriptId":20701,"text":"“嗯……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"538001-EPILOGUE:20701:8","scriptId":20701,"text":"刚说完，周围的景色又变了……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-158.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
